---
layout: null
permalink: /search.json
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  Search index. 46 posts of full text is ~61 KB gzipped, which is smaller than
  lunr.js alone, so /search/ scores this itself rather than taking a dependency.
  jsonify does the quoting and escaping; do not hand-roll it.
{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- for post in site.posts -%}
{%- unless forloop.first -%},{%- endunless -%}
{"t":{{ post.title | jsonify }},
 "u":{{ post.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
 "d":{{ post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" | jsonify }},
 "g":{{ post.tags | join: " " | jsonify }},
 "c":{{ post.categories | join: " " | jsonify }},
 "x":{{ post.content | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }}}
{%- endfor -%}
]
